					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-383387#post-2330417</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-383387/scp-924#post-2330417</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 03 Jul 2015 10:55:22 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Jorum</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>391327</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I'm one of the &quot;this isn't a SCP&quot; pedants but I think this one is OK.<br /> While they don't appear to do anything overtly supernatural, aquatic humanoids with gills (that look human) is completely at odds with our understanding of evolution and unexplainable to science.</p> <p>(publicly at least. Maybe not unexplanable to Foundation scientists, they have access to lots of secret knowledge about ancient humanoids and Bigfoot-civilisation and aliens and who knows what else)</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
