				<wikidot:authorName>Vincent_Redgrave</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1423031</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Not bad, not bad. Good pic, creepy, and the description and containment sections are just long enough to feel complete, without feeling too short or having any excess padding. The only complaint that I have is that the addendum is incredibly short and under-detailed. I want to know more about what happened when one'a these guys popped out of the ocean that could screw up a ship.</p> <p>+1</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
